      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Related by or duplicate of:\nUnicode fax sign (℻, 0x213B) being used to evade Player Search https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/unicode-fax-sign-0x213b-being-used-to-evade-player-search\n[Security] Create a character whitelist to prevent hiding usernames through unicode characters https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/security-create-a-character-whitelist-to-prevent-hiding-usernames-through-unicod\nSpecific user profile not found by user search https://vrchat.canny.io/website-bug-reports/p/specific-user-profile-not-found-by-user-search\nDisplay an user ID in the menu to make reporting abuse easilier https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/display-an-user-id-in-the-menu-to-make-reporting-abuse-easilier",
